    &\leq \sqrt{2\alpha^{succ}_{0} t_{0}^2v_{0} +2\norm{u_0 }^2 + \lambda_1^2  } \leq  \lambda_1 + \left(2\alpha^{succ}_{0} t_{0}^2v_{0} +2\norm{u_0 }^2  \right)^{1/2}.
